    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541030/extras/29ed7c33e3c58fb5f66e46054d296a33.avif?t=1754479814\" /></div><br><br>Ocak is a turn-based 3D/2D dungeon crawler game where you go on an adventure and fix <strong>G\u029f\u026a\u1d1b\ud835\udcb8\u029c\u1d07\u02e2</strong> with your companions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541030/extras/e88ebaf1d940b3849b22d623f81dc36d.poster.avif?t=1754479814\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541030/extras/e88ebaf1d940b3849b22d623f81dc36d.webm?t=1754479814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect loot and upgrade your companions with over 150 items.<br></li><li>Discover dungeons and collect bounties.<br></li><li>Kill stuff.<br></li><li>Turn-based combat.<br></li><li>Eat delicious meals.<br></li><li>Unique art style.<br></li><li>Find at least 4 glitch including you.<br></li><li>Talk stuff.<br></li><li>M\u0334\u0301\u0309\u0333\u032aa\u0338\u034a\u0341\u031fy\u0334\u035d\u0302\u0318\u0349b\u0336\u034b\u0357\u0306\u0318\u031ee\u0334\u0305\u030b\u0327 \u0336\u0344\u0351\u0313\u0349\u0354\u031e5\u0336\u034c\u033f\u0300\u0345\u031d\u034d \u0335\u031b\u0312\u0309\u0349\u0354\u0330g\u0335\u0303\u0312\u0331l\u0337\u0310\u0309\u0308\u032ei\u0336\u0313\u0351\u0317\u0328\u035at\u0338\u030e\u034c\u034ec\u0335\u0312\u0309\u0358\u0345\u0323\u0327h\u0338\u0357\u0304\u0318\u0348.<br></li><li>Kill more stuff but please not all of them...</li></ul>",
